        <div style="width:48px;height:2px;background:#6e5438;margin:22px 0 0"></div>
        <p style="color:#6b4e35;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;max-width:520px;margin:22px 0 0">Whichever side you're on, everything lives on one page — and takes minutes to set up.</p>
