            <li style="font-size:.9rem;color:#2c1a0e;line-height:1.6;padding-left:24px;position:relative"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;top:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#2f5d45;color:#fff;font-size:.62rem;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;line-height:1">✓</span>Share one link — <strong style="color:#2f5d45;font-weight:600">myahsits.com/yourname</strong></li>
