          <a href="/signup" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;align-self:flex-start;margin-top:auto;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5d45;text-decoration:none;border:1.5px solid rgba(110,84,56,.45);border-radius:50px;padding:13px 28px;transition:background .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s">Get started as a sitter &rarr;</a>
        </div>
